An '''aegis''' is a type of [[active skill|skill]] and associated [[buff]] granted by certain [[item]]s and [[Ascendancy class|Ascendancy passive skills]]. While active, the buff takes a specified amount of damage from [[hit]]s (typically of specific [[damage type]]s) before it is dealt to [[life]] or [[energy shield]] until it is fully depleted. The aegis will automatically restore to full after a skill-specific duration after either fully depleting the buff or not taking hit damage of the aegis' type for the same duration. Aegis skills' mitigation takes priority before [[Guard Skill]]s<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3123794</ref>.

==Skills==
* {{sl|id=PhysicalAegis}} (from {{il|The Ghastly Theatre}})
* {{sl|Elemental Aegis}} (from {{il|Magna Eclipsis}})
* {{sl|Cold Aegis}} (from {{il|Vix Lunaris}})
* {{sl|id=FireAegis}} (from {{il|Invictus Solaris}})
* {{sl|Lightning Aegis}} (from {{il|page=Perepiteia (Synthesised)|Perepiteia}} and its [[Perepiteia (Fractured)|fractured variant]])
* {{sl|Primal Aegis}} (from [[Bastion of Elements]] ascendancy passive skill)

